# Lintian overrides for md-notes, installed at
# /usr/share/lintian/overrides/md-notes (davison/md-notes#137).
#
# One tag, and it is not a defect to fix: the daemon is a single static Go
# binary, built with CGO_ENABLED=0 for linux/amd64 and linux/arm64, and that
# is the whole distribution story of this project — the same binary is what
# the GitHub Release carries, what the AUR package installs and what this
# package installs. Building it dynamically would mean giving up the property
# every other channel relies on, to satisfy a check aimed at packages in the
# Debian archive, where the shared-library policy exists so that a security
# update to a library reaches every package that links it. This package is not
# in the archive and is rebuilt from source on every release, which is the
# same remedy by another road.
#
# Recorded on davison/md-notes#137 with the lintian output either way.
md-notes: statically-linked-binary [usr/bin/mdn]
